      "main_details": "<p>You may now equip a shield in your main hand slot. As long as you have two shields<br>equipped, you gain the benefits of both items and may treat them as the following<br>combined two-handed melee brawling weapon:<br>WEAPON ACCURACY DAMAGE<br>Twin Shields 【MIG + MIG】 【HR + 5】 physical<br>Deals extra damage equal to your 【SL】 in defensive mastery (above).</p>",
